## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a simple, scalable ingestion path with clear isolation and observable state using familiar GCP primitives.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub streaming ingestion
- Cloud Run consumer with auto-scaling
- Idempotent processing via Pub/Sub message_id and an idempotence store
- Per-tenant isolation using separate BigQuery datasets
- Least-privilege IAM, Cloud Logging/Monitoring
- Basic test plan with replay and failure injection

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-handler showing idempotent check
async function handle(msg) {
  const id = msg.message_id;
  if (await isProcessed(id)) return;
  await enrichAndStore(msg);
  await markProcessed(id);
}
```

